  "zh": "# 今日AI突破与苹果折叠屏新品引关注，Shopify并购Tailwind及政策动向成为焦点\n## AI 与科技\n- **OpenAI 攻克千禧年难题**：OpenAI 声称解决长期悬而未决的千禧年数学难题，引发学界广泛关注。\n- **Shopify 收购 Tailwind**：电商平台 Shopify 宣布收购前端框架 Tailwind CSS，将深度绑定开发生态。\n- **Desert Ant Labs 本地快速模型**：新兴实验室发布可在设备端运行的轻量级 AI 模型，强调低延迟与隐私保护。\n## 产品发布\n- **iPhone Duo 折叠屏真机上手**：首批评测显示 iPhone Duo 折叠屏工艺尚有改进空间，但创新形态吸引眼球。\n- **iPhone 18 Pro 真机上手**：新一代旗舰在影像与性能上提升明显，价格走高成为讨论焦点。\n- **AirPods 5 真机测评**：AirPods 5 开放式主动降噪表现出色，佩戴舒适度获好评。\n## 行业动向\n- **特朗普关税政策 现状**：最新数据显示特朗普时期的关税措施对美国制造业影响复杂，政策走向仍存不确定性。\n- **多所名校 停招学硕**：国内多所重点高校宣布暂停学术型硕士招生，引发教育资源分配及就业压力担忧。",
  "en": "# Today's highlights include AI breakthroughs, Apple's foldable iPhone Duo hands-on, Shopify's Tailwind acquisition, and key policy shifts.\n## AI & Tech\n- **OpenAI solves millennium problem**: OpenAI claims to have cracked a long-standing millennium math puzzle, sparking wide academic interest.\n- **Shopify acquires Tailwind**: E-commerce platform Shopify announced it is acquiring the Tailwind CSS framework, tightening its grip on the developer ecosystem.\n- **Desert Ant Labs releases on-device AI models**: The startup unveiled lightweight AI models designed to run directly on devices, emphasizing low latency and privacy.\n## Product Launches\n- **iPhone Duo foldable hands-on**: Early reviews note the Duo's foldable screen still needs refinement, but its novel form factor draws attention.\n- **iPhone 18 Pro hands-on**: The new flagship delivers noticeable camera and performance upgrades, with its higher price becoming a talking point.\n- **AirPods 5 hands-on review**: AirPods 5's open-ear active noise cancellation impresses, and comfort earns positive feedback.\n## Industry & Policy\n- **Trump tariff policy status**: Latest data shows the Trump-era tariffs have mixed effects on U.S. manufacturing, leaving policy direction uncertain.\n- **Chinese universities halt master's enrollment**: Several top Chinese universities have paused admissions for academic master's programs, raising concerns over resource allocation and job market pressure."
